      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
        Next mobility quest
      </h2>
    </mj-text>
    <mj-image
          border-radius="10px"
          padding="10px 12px"
          width="600px"
          src="https://www.dubaisummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg"
          alt="REPLACE_ME"
          href="https://www.dubaisummary.com/"
          target="_blank"
        />

    <mj-text padding="10px 12px 16px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
      <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>What’s happening? </strong>Dubai’s Roads and Transport Authority has opened registration for the 14th <a href="https://www.emirates247.com/uae/have-a-smart-transport-idea-dubais-rta-wants-to-hear-from-you/1550" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Dubai Awards for Sustainable Transport 2026</a> (DAST 2026). The award invites government bodies, private companies, schools, researchers, transport experts, and students to submit projects, research, or ideas that can improve sustainable mobility. Launched in 2008, DAST rewards innovation in clean, safe, inclusive, and environmentally friendly transport.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>Categories:</strong> DAST 2026 includes four main categories. Sustainability focuses on green and environmentally friendly transport solutions. Innovation rewards fresh mobility ideas, including student and next-generation projects. Inclusivity recognises safe, accessible, and transport-for-all initiatives. Elite honours the strongest idea, project, or research concept chosen from across all categories by the jury, making it the award’s top recognition.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>How to apply?</strong> Applicants can register for DAST 2026 through the RTA’s official DAST digital portal. They must first create an account by registering their organisation, whether government, private, or educational, or sign in as an individual researcher. Next, they should choose the award category that best matches their project. Once all details are complete, they can submit the application before the June 2026 deadline.</p>
    </mj-text>
  </mj-column>
</mj-section>
