          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><a href="https://yubihandrollbar.com/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">Yubi Handroll Bar</a></strong> introduces a refined dining experience at 25 Jump Street in One Central. Created by 7 Management in collaboration with chef Reif Othman, the menu blends Japanese street-food tradition with a hip-hop vibe. The interior features a long bar where diners sit on stools and watch chefs prepare hand-rolls on demand. The design mixes natural wood, soft lighting, textured wall murals, and neon accents, creating a lively blend of street style and elegance.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong><em>Pro tip:</em></strong><em> Sit at the counter for a front-row view of the hand-roll craft and ask the chef for the “chef’s roll.”</em></p>
