<mj-text padding="0px 12px 10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Bjorg Construction is hiring a Construction Manager who can manage construction projects from planning to completion while ensuring timelines, budgets, safety rules, and quality standards are met. It includes supervising site workers, subcontractors, and suppliers, monitoring progress, solving issues, reviewing drawings, maintaining safety compliance, preparing reports, managing costs, and coordinating with clients and stakeholders.</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><a href="https://dubai.dubizzle.com/jobs/construction/2026/5/13/construction-manager-2-655---8d27e5ada3ee43a0b15c553892441bc7/" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;"><strong>Register here </strong></a><strong> </strong></p>
