            </td>
            <!-- Right flexible line -->
            <td
              valign="middle"
              style="
                width: 100%;
                font-size: 0;
                line-height: 0;
                padding: 0px;
                mso-line-height-rule: exactly;
              "
            >
              <div style="height: 0px; border-top: 4px solid #eeca66">
                &nbsp;
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </mj-table>
        <mj-image border-radius="10px" padding="10px 12px" width="600px" src="https://www.dubaisummary.com/email/images/REPLACE_ME.jpg" alt="REPLACE_ME" href="https://www.dubaisummary.com/" target="_blank" />
      
<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Parking gets smarter
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Parkin has started installing <a href="https://gulfnews.com/uae/transport/parkin-rolls-out-500-ai-cameras-for-automated-street-parking-payments-across-dubai-1.500538775" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">AI-enabled cameras across busy areas</a> to automate parking fee collection and monitor parking spaces in real time. The first phase includes more than 500 curb- and pole-mounted cameras in areas such as Burj Khalifa, Trade Centre 1, and Al Corniche, along with 200 more cameras in controlled parking lots. The solar-powered system reads number plates, records entry and exit times, tracks parking duration, and enables automatic payment through the Parkin app and digital wallet.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Fees made flexible
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">UAE schools are <a href="https://gulfnews.com/living-in-uae/education/uae-school-fees-how-dubai-schools-are-helping-families-with-flexible-payment-plans-1.500538880" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">providing flexible payment plans</a> to help families manage rising education expenses and monetary pressure. Several schools are working directly with parents to create tailored fee arrangements, including monthly instalments, deferred payments, sibling discounts, scholarships, and customised support. The focus is on easing short-term pressure, keeping education accessible, and ensuring students continue learning without disruption.</p>
</mj-text>

<mj-divider
  border-style="dashed"
  border-width="1px"
  border-color="lightgrey"
  padding="0px 12px 4px 12px"
/>

<mj-text
  padding="10px 12px"
  font-family="Austin News Text Web, TNYAdobeCaslonPro, 'Times New Roman', serif"
  color="#000000"
>
  <h2 style="font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; margin: 0;">
    Banking seat bid
  </h2>
</mj-text>

<mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">The UAE is seeking a <a href="https://gulfnews.com/business/banking/uae-seeks-a-board-seat-at-swift-as-banking-sector-climbs-global-rankings-1.500539025" target="_blank" style="text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 2px solid #102341; color: black;">seat on the board of Swift</a>, the global messaging network used by banks and monetary institutions for cross-border payments. UAE Banks Federation officials said discussions are underway as the country rises in global rankings for trade-related payment activity. A board seat would give the UAE greater visibility in global payments infrastructure, banking standards, cybersecurity, and cross-border systems.</p>
</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
