        <mj-text padding="10px 12px" font-family="Arial" color="#000000">
          <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Dubai government employees will get a nine-day break for Arafah Day and Eid Al Adha 2026, with holidays running from May 25 to May 29, plus weekends. Work resumes on June 1.</p>
